# Imported CAD assets are stored byte-for-byte so that the SHA-256 values in
# manifest.json stay valid on every platform. No end-of-line normalisation.
* -text
*.3mf binary
*.f3d binary
*.stl binary
*.png binary
*.step linguist-generated
*.3mf linguist-generated
*.stl linguist-generated
*.f3d linguist-generated
